Package: rtists
Title: Tissue Integrity Superimposed on Tractography Streamlines
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        given = "Aymeric",
        family = "Stamm",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "aymeric.stamm@cnrs.fr",
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8725-3654")
    ))
Description: Provides interactive 3-D visualisation of tractography streamlines,
    bundles, and bundle sets defined in the 'fiber' package. Aesthetics such as
    line colour can be mapped to per-point, per-streamline, or per-bundle
    metadata, or derived from the local fibre orientation. See Dell'Acqua, F.,
    Descoteaux, M. and Leemans, A. (2024) "Handbook of Diffusion MR Tractography"
    <doi:10.1016/C2018-0-02520-7> for more about the mathematical and computational
    underpinnings of diffusion MRI tractography.
